{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach visible objects, grab them, check properties, move to destination, or scan area for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <SubTree ID = WanderAround    />\"",
    "BT": {
